Viera Energy Balance

Food illustrations in public/assets are generated specifically for this project.
The movement illustrations in public/assets/living-movement.webp were generated
with OpenAI ImageGen for the Viera Living UI candidate. They illustrate activities
and are not exercise technique instructions.
The six meal images for the USDA-indexed recipes and living-movement-home.webp
were generated for Viera with OpenAI ImageGen. They are illustrations, not
measurements of portions, evidence of menus, or exercise technique instruction.
Viera's app icons (icon.png and icon-large.png) are present in the first
Viera Energy Balance source commit, 4f7627e. No separate upstream design
credit or original art file was identified in this audit.
Third-party technique videos are linked or embedded from their original YouTube
publishers and are not redistributed here. The repository license does not cover
the linked videos, the linked maps, the OpenStreetMap-derived coordinates
covered by ODbL, or the external nutrition reference sites.

public/vendor contains the Firebase JavaScript SDK 13.4.0 from the Google
Firebase CDN. The full upstream license, including third-party notices, is
included in public/vendor/LICENSE.firebase. The AI Logic and App Check
bundles mark the relative import change made to support offline loading.

