OpenStreetMap coordinates
The bundled Paris examples Don Giovanni, Amalfi and Amalfitana use locations
from OpenStreetMap nodes 8016720377, 11364651926 and 2026702530. Their
OpenStreetMap-derived data is available under ODbL 1.0.
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
The upstream Photon demo endpoint may throttle use and has no availability
guarantee. https://github.com/komoot/photon#demo-server

Ho Chi Minh City place references
See the README citation table for restaurant contacts and public location
references from Aroundus and PinGuide. The restaurant directory records a
small set of factual lookup entries and source links. No menus, map images,
map tiles or provider datasets are included. The separate Ben Thanh location
anchor is sourced from Wikidata Q3232879.

